33,2,1,talk,Mio,,"The transport costs are significant, but the publicly run beds seem affordable.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Shizue,,I found out that the seniors say year-groups mix best when they sleep in the same place.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,The application process for public bookings is complex and time-consuming.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Rin,,The clubs that went inland had issues with overcrowding and early lights out.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"The canteen closure means we'd have to cook for ourselves, and a third can't be on campus by nine without a bed.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
