40,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Mio, whole-building lets might be an option, but they have strict terms.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Shizue, yes, sleep is crucial for effective training.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
