44,2,3,talk,Shizue,,We should consider a place where everyone can stay together.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Mio, the headcount is fixed weeks ahead, and the deposit is non-refundable.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Rin,,That's a problem if someone drops out late.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
